### Aktif ana rapor türlerini getir
GET http://localhost:8080/api/referanslar/ana-rapor-turleri
Accept: application/json

### Seçilen ana türe bağlı rapor türlerini getir
GET http://localhost:8080/api/referanslar/ana-rapor-turleri/fef60cfd-a4d4-40a0-9cb0-a179101e4ef0/rapor-turleri
Accept: application/json

### Aktif vergi kodlarını getir
GET http://localhost:8080/api/referanslar/vergi-kodlari
Accept: application/json
### Yeni rapor oluştur
POST http://localhost:8080/api/raporlar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vergiKimlikNo": "1234567890",
  "tcKimlikNo": null,
  "anaRaporTuruId": "fef60cfd-a4d4-40a0-9cb0-a179101e4ef0",
  "raporTuruId": "40a07a33-2601-44ac-84ce-61b0aa944a23",
  "vergiKoduId": "5e45198b-38e1-4235-9c4a-3b01ddab3715",
  "duzenlemeTarihi": "2026-08-10",
  "aciklama": "Test raporu"
}
### Hata testi: VKN ve TCKN ikisi de boş
POST http://localhost:8080/api/raporlar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vergiKimlikNo": null,
  "tcKimlikNo": null,
  "anaRaporTuruId": "fef60cfd-a4d4-40a0-9cb0-a179101e4ef0",
